  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Negation of given statement is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using De Morgan&#39;s law <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using double negation law <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math>,&nbsp;and De Morgan&#39;s law</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p>Using distributive law&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
